                <note rend="inline" type="source">861a.01/69: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Vladivostok</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Macgowan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-08T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                                1921—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your 96 September 3rd, 2 p.m. evidently refers to the present Vladivostok
                    Government, while Departments September 1, 6 p.m. refers to former Vladivostok
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
